* @title FAIL forces all alternatives for logical word filtering
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 2, Section 2.13
* @input >>>
* ALPHA
* BETA
* ABRACADABRA
* ABSOLUTELY
* AWFUL
* ALBEIT
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* ACCEPTABLE WORDS ARE:
*
*  BETA
*  ABSOLUTELY
*  ALBEIT
* <<<
          &ANCHOR = 1; &TRIM = 1
          OUTPUT = 'ACCEPTABLE WORDS ARE:'
          OUTPUT =
          PAT = (BREAK('A') $ A | BREAK('B') $ B |
+                BREAK('C') $ C) FAIL
LOOP      STRING = ' ' INPUT :F(END)
          A =
          B =
          C =
          STRING PAT
          (DIFFER(A) DIFFER(B) IDENT(C)) :F(LOOP)
          OUTPUT = STRING :(LOOP)
END
